        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/coastaltown/_scene_copperhead.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 8c2d29b8-8ce3-42c4-b660-6a3e10d6da04).Image",
        "Description": "Elizibeth, I&apos;ve enlisted the help of an old contact, named 47. He is earliy quiet and unfeeling to the point of there is no difference between life and death for him. I entrusted him with this Blacklist entry, The Sapienza Five, becuase this crew doesn&apos;t quite make the cut. Luisa Doria, Romano Greece, Berto Russo, Davide Rizzo, and Messi Arcuri all are in on a form of cabal to shut down production and steal the remainig assets.These Blacklisters require only the skills of The Hitman. Red out.",
